:====
# A method that `extend Number` adds takes the number it is called on as `this`, of that number's own type.

. i = 5
. f = 2.5
-- i.doubled()
-- f.doubled()
-- i.kind()
-- f.kind()

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ extend Number

────────────────────
+ doubled

this * 2

────────────────────
+ kind String

"${type-of this}"

:----

10
5
[TypeInfo I64]
[TypeInfo F64]
